item.description:
Publications &amp; Research Publications &ldquo;Istanbul Flower Auction: The Need for Speed&rdquo;
Co-authors: Isa Hafalir, Onur Kesten, Katerina Sherstyuk, and Cong Tao.
Journal: Games and Economic Behavior (2026).
Links: Journal DOI | arXiv Preprint
Abstract: We investigate speed-related issues and bidding behaviors in the Istanbul Flower Auction, highlighting mechanical design limits and bidders&rsquo; reaction speeds in Dutch auctions. Working Papers &amp; Work-in-Progress &ldquo;Non-linear Pricing with Resale&rdquo;
Co-authors: Isa E. Hafalir and Hadi Yektas.
